WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.600
Get into the habit of paying your full credit card bill each month.

2
00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:06.600
If you only pay the minimum fee, you'll end up with huge interest payments.

3
00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:08.600
And these can really add up.

4
00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:11.600
Getting into debt trouble can be very stressful.

5
00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:13.600
Stay on top of your finances.

6
00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:15.600
Live within your means and what you can afford.

7
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:19.600
Set your own limits and use debt only when it's to your advantage.

8
00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:21.600
Now back to my pool.
